    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-028> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-028-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-028-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-028 — Nautilus log-spiral & septal wall geometry (remediated) — MorphoEval overall 71.1/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 adds center grid search, regime/ablation panel, morphometric CV exports, and datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-028/result.json with mixed verdict (log spiral beats Archimedean on envelope; empirical W from section remains below literature W≈2.85). Overall 71.1/100 (faithfulness 68.0, reproducibility 78.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 76, Morphological realism / specimen match 58, Parameter expressivity 74, Morphometric validation 70, Source and data traceability 85, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 80. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_028_the_logarithmic_spiral_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-028_the-logarithmic-spiral.py at HEAD, image/png, 227393 B, 2100×750 px, artifact_sha256 0d7f40e635aac342e7f8d01cdb7a8389c6b446e67d0235a0622e4e2fd48ccf17 (sha256 0d7f40e635aac342e7f8d01cdb7a8389c6b446e67d0235a0622e4e2fd48ccf17), spec_fingerprint 08a1c83cf7770b52575a4e508d980714ec0f1886be1762236a3a8e784f1ff175. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 08a1c83cf7770b52575a4e508d980714ec0f1886be1762236a3a8e784f1ff175; artifact_sha256: 0d7f40e635aac342e7f8d01cdb7a8389c6b446e67d0235a0622e4e2fd48ccf17. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-28-t1917-028-the-logarithmic-spiral-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) Ch. XI: Nautilus spiral/septa geometric relations (wall meeting, involute/evolute diagrams); reconstructed_in_script: Radial CV segmentation, log-spiral vs Archimedean ablation, 3-regime sweep, septum overlay, result.json verdict; transfer_boundary: 2D section vs Thompson 3D radiograph schematic; W_median from outer hits is approximate; does_not_claim: Definitive refutation/support of all diagrammatic constructions without IA Fig. 304-307 digitization." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.711"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
